---
---

<section id="cs-handover" class="cs-ho" aria-labelledby="cs-handover-title">
	<div class="cs-ho-intro">
		<p class="cs-eyebrow cs-rise">After launch</p>
		<h2 id="cs-handover-title" class="cs-rise cs-rise-d1">We do not disappear on launch day.</h2>
		<p class="cs-ho-intro-text cs-rise cs-rise-d2">Going live is the start of the relationship, not the end of it. Here is what comes with every system we build.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="cs-ho-panel cs-fade">
		<ol class="cs-ho-grid">
			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-a cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">OWNERSHIP</span>
				</div>
				<h3>It is yours.</h3>
				<p>We agree in writing, before we start, who owns the code and the data and how you can take it with you. No lock in, no surprises.</p>
				<svg class="cs-ho-art cs-ho-art-a" viewBox="0 0 96 96" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
					<g class="hd-a-file">
						<rect x="18" y="44" width="58" height="44" rx="7" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path d="M29 58h34M29 68h26M29 78h30" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
					</g>
					<g class="hd-a-key">
						<circle cx="46" cy="27" r="11" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.8" />
						<path d="M46 38v22m0-11h8m-8 7h6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
					</g>
					<circle class="hd-a-dot" cx="65" cy="18" r="2.5" fill="var(--kt-clay-light)" />
				</svg>
			</li>

			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-b cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">TRAINING</span>
					<svg class="cs-ho-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<circle cx="12" cy="16" r="6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path class="hd-b-tick hd-b-tick1" d="m9.4 16 1.9 1.9 3.5-4" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
						<circle cx="12" cy="32" r="6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path class="hd-b-tick hd-b-tick2" d="m9.4 32 1.9 1.9 3.5-4" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
						<circle cx="12" cy="48" r="6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path class="hd-b-tick hd-b-tick3" d="m9.4 48 1.9 1.9 3.5-4" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
						<path class="hd-b-line hd-b-line1" d="M25 16h30" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-b-line hd-b-line2" d="M25 32h30" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-b-line hd-b-line3" d="M25 48h30" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Your team learns it properly.</h3>
				<p>We walk your people through the system with real examples from your business, and we stay close while everyone gets used to it.</p>
			</li>

			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-c cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">SUPPORT</span>
					<svg class="cs-ho-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<g class="hd-c-bubble1"><rect x="7" y="10" width="34" height="24" rx="6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path d="m17 34-4 8 11-8" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" /></g>
						<path d="M15 19h18M15 26h12" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<g class="hd-c-bubble2"><rect x="26" y="30" width="31" height="22" rx="6" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path d="m47 52 6 6-1-8" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" /></g>
						<path d="M33 38h17M33 45h11" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Someone to call.</h3>
				<p>A clear way to report a problem, and a person who answers.</p>
			</li>

			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-d cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">UPDATES</span>
					<svg class="cs-ho-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path class="hd-d-line" d="M11 30h42" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<circle class="hd-d-dot hd-d-dot1" cx="12" cy="30" r="5" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<circle class="hd-d-dot hd-d-dot2" cx="32" cy="30" r="5" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<circle class="hd-d-dot hd-d-dot3" cx="52" cy="30" r="5" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" />
						<text x="12" y="49" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="8">v1</text>
						<text x="32" y="49" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-fill)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="8">v1.1</text>
						<text x="52" y="49" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--cs-soft-accent)" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="8">v1.2</text>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>It keeps improving.</h3>
				<p>Fixes and new features shipped in small steps.</p>
			</li>

			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-e cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">DOCUMENTATION</span>
					<svg class="cs-ho-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<g class="hd-e-back"><rect x="9" y="8" width="34" height="42" rx="4" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path class="hd-e-backline hd-e-backline1" d="M17 19h18" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-e-backline hd-e-backline2" d="M17 27h18" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-e-backline hd-e-backline3" d="M17 35h12" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" /></g>
						<g class="hd-e-front"><rect x="21" y="16" width="34" height="42" rx="4" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
						<path class="hd-e-frontline hd-e-frontline1" d="M29 28h18" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-e-frontline hd-e-frontline2" d="M29 36h18" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						<path class="hd-e-frontline hd-e-frontline3" d="M29 44h12" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" /></g>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Written down in plain words.</h3>
				<p>Simple guides for your team, and clear notes for any developer who works on the system later.</p>
			</li>

			<li class="cs-ho-tile cs-ho-f cs-rise">
				<div class="cs-ho-tile-top">
					<span class="cs-ho-label">CARE</span>
					<svg class="cs-ho-art" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path class="hd-f-shield" d="M32 7 52 15v17c0 14-9 22-20 26C21 54 12 46 12 32V15L32 7Z" stroke="var(--cs-soft-accent)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
						<path class="hd-f-pulse" d="M17 34h7l4-7 6 14 4-7h9" stroke="var(--cs-soft-line)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3>Watched over and backed up.</h3>
				<p>We keep an eye on the system and keep safe copies of your data, so a bad day does not become a lost week.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</div>

	<p class="cs-ho-end cs-rise">Want to know exactly what you would get? <a href="/quote" data-quote aria-label="Ask us what you would get with custom software">Ask us <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4" /></svg></a></p>
</section>

<style>
	.cs-ho {
		scroll-margin-top: var(--header-h, 76px);
		padding-block: clamp(2.75rem, 4.5vw, 4rem);
		overflow-x: clip;
	}

	.cs-ho-intro {
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: 0 24px;
	}

	.cs-eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 .75rem;
		color: var(--kt-teal);
		font: 500 .75rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cs-eyebrow::before {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2px;
		margin-right: .65rem;
		vertical-align: middle;
		background: var(--kt-clay);
		content: '';
	}

	.cs-ho h2 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-text);
		font: 600 clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem)/1.08 var(--font-heading);
		letter-spacing: -.03em;
	}

	.cs-ho-intro-text {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		max-width: 44rem;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Panel and tiles --------------------------------------------------- */
	.cs-ho-panel {
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		padding: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--cs-soft-border);
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--cs-soft-bg);
	}

	.cs-ho-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
		grid-auto-rows: minmax(150px, auto);
		gap: 1rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.cs-ho-a { grid-column: 1 / span 2; grid-row: 1 / span 2; }
	.cs-ho-b { grid-column: 3 / span 2; grid-row: 1; }
	.cs-ho-c { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; }
	.cs-ho-d { grid-column: 4; grid-row: 2; }
	.cs-ho-e { grid-column: 1 / span 2; grid-row: 3; }
	.cs-ho-f { grid-column: 3 / span 2; grid-row: 3; }

	.cs-ho-tile {
		position: relative;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--cs-soft-tile-border);
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: var(--cs-soft-tile);
	}

	.cs-ho-tile-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: .75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.cs-ho-label {
		color: var(--cs-soft-accent);
		font: 500 .72rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);
		letter-spacing: .08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.cs-ho-tile h3 {
		margin: 0 0 .75rem;
		padding-right: 3.5rem;
		color: var(--cs-soft-text);
		font: 600 clamp(1.15rem, 1.5vw, 1.4rem)/1.2 var(--font-heading);
		letter-spacing: -.01em;
	}

	.cs-ho-tile p {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 34rem;
		color: var(--cs-soft-muted);
		font: 400 .95rem/1.6 var(--font-body);
	}

	.cs-ho-art {
		position: absolute;
		top: 1rem;
		right: 1.25rem;
		width: 56px;
		height: 56px;
	}

	.cs-ho-art-a {
		position: absolute;
		top: auto;
		right: 1.5rem;
		bottom: 1.5rem;
		width: 96px;
		height: 96px;
	}

	.cs-ho-a h3 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.9vw, 1.65rem); padding-right: 0; }
	.cs-ho-a p { max-width: 22rem; }

	/* Assemble reveal: starting offsets are local; the shared observer in
	   CustomSoftwarePage.astro adds .is-in to every .cs-rise / .cs-fade. */
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-panel.cs-fade { transition-duration: 500ms; }

	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-a { transform: translateX(-28px); }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-b { transform: translateY(-24px); }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-c { transform: translateX(28px); }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-d { transform: translateY(28px); }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-e { transform: translateX(-28px); }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-f { transform: translateY(28px); }

	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-tile {
		transition-duration: 700ms;
		transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1);
	}

	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-a { transition-delay: 0ms; }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-b { transition-delay: 90ms; }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-c { transition-delay: 180ms; }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-d { transition-delay: 270ms; }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-e { transition-delay: 360ms; }
	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-f { transition-delay: 450ms; }

	:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-tile.is-in {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: none;
	}

	:global(html.cs-js[data-fx='lite']) .cs-ho-tile,
	:global(html.cs-js[data-fx='lite']) .cs-ho-panel {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: none;
		transition: none;
		transition-delay: 0ms;
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-tile,
		:global(html.cs-js) .cs-ho-panel {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: none;
			transition: none;
			transition-delay: 0ms;
		}
	}

	/* Closing line ------------------------------------------------------ */
	.cs-ho-end {
		max-width: var(--container-inner);
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		padding: 0 24px;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		font-size: .95rem;
	}
	.cs-ho-end a {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: .3rem;
		color: var(--color-accent-strong);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-color: var(--kt-clay);
		text-underline-offset: .3rem;
	}
	.cs-ho-end a svg { width: .9rem; height: .9rem; }

	/* Tablet: 2 columns, A and F span both. */
	@media (min-width: 600px) and (max-width: 899px) {
		.cs-ho-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
		.cs-ho-a { grid-column: 1 / span 2; grid-row: auto; }
		.cs-ho-b,
		.cs-ho-c,
		.cs-ho-d,
		.cs-ho-e { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
		.cs-ho-f { grid-column: 1 / span 2; grid-row: auto; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 599px) {
		.cs-ho-intro, .cs-ho-end { padding-inline: 20px; }
		.cs-ho-panel { padding: 1rem; }
		.cs-ho-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
		.cs-ho-a,
		.cs-ho-b,
		.cs-ho-c,
		.cs-ho-d,
		.cs-ho-e,
		.cs-ho-f { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
		.cs-ho-art { position: static; width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-top: .75rem; }
		.cs-ho-tile h3 { padding-right: 0; }
		.cs-ho-art-a { width: 72px; height: 72px; margin-top: 1rem; }
	}

	@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
		.cs-ho-tile:hover { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cs-soft-text) 24%, transparent); }
	}

	/* Icon motion hooks ------------------------------------------------- */
	.cs-ho-art .hd-a-key,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-a-dot,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-b-line,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-c-bubble1,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-c-bubble2,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-d-dot3,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-e-back,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-e-front,
	.cs-ho-art .hd-f-shield {
		transition: transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1);
	}
	.cs-ho-art [class*='hd-'] { transform-box: fill-box; }
	.cs-ho-art .hd-a-key { transform-origin: 50% 25%; }
	.cs-ho-art .hd-d-line { transform-origin: left center; }
	.cs-ho-art .hd-f-pulse { transform-origin: left center; }

	@keyframes hd-pop {
		from { transform: scale(.6); opacity: .5; }
		to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
	}
	@keyframes hd-dot-up {
		0% { transform: scale(1); }
		50% { transform: scale(1.25); }
		100% { transform: scale(1); }
	}
	@keyframes hd-line-wipe {
		from { transform: scaleX(.55); }
		to { transform: scaleX(1); }
	}
	@keyframes hd-pulse {
		0% { transform: scaleX(.6); opacity: .5; }
		60% { opacity: 1; }
		100% { transform: scaleX(1); opacity: 1; }
	}
	@keyframes hd-touch {
		0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
		45% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: .85; }
		100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
	}

	@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
		/* A: the key swings round its ring and lifts; the clay dot pops once. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-a-key { transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(-14deg); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-a-dot { transform: scale(1.6); }

		/* B: ticks pop in sequence, then the three lines follow. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-tick { animation: hd-pop 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-tick1 { animation-delay: 0ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-tick2 { animation-delay: 80ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-tick3 { animation-delay: 160ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-line { transform: translateX(3px); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-line1 { transition-delay: 0ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-line2 { transition-delay: 80ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-b-line3 { transition-delay: 160ms; }

		/* C: the two bubbles drift apart. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-c-bubble1 { transform: translateY(-3px); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-c-bubble2 { transform: translateY(3px); transition-delay: 90ms; }

		/* D: the connector wipes in, dots pop, teal dot grows. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-line { animation: hd-line-wipe 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-dot { animation: hd-dot-up 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-dot1 { animation-delay: 0ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-dot2 { animation-delay: 80ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-dot3 { animation-delay: 160ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-d-dot3 { transform: scale(1.35); }

		/* E: pages slide opposite ways, their lines fade up in sequence. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-front { transform: translateX(3px) rotate(3deg); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-back { transform: translateX(-3px); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-frontline,
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-backline { animation: hd-pop 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-backline1 { animation-delay: 0ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-backline2 { animation-delay: 80ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-backline3 { animation-delay: 160ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-frontline1 { animation-delay: 240ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-frontline2 { animation-delay: 320ms; }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-e-frontline3 { animation-delay: 400ms; }

		/* F: the shield lifts, the pulse sweeps with an opacity flash. */
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-f-shield { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.06); }
		.cs-ho-tile:hover .hd-f-pulse { animation: hd-pulse 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
	}

	/* Touch screens: play each icon once as its tile reveals. */
	@media (hover: none) {
		.cs-ho-tile.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation: hd-touch 600ms cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1) both; }
		.cs-ho-a.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 0ms; }
		.cs-ho-b.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 90ms; }
		.cs-ho-c.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 180ms; }
		.cs-ho-d.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 270ms; }
		.cs-ho-e.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 360ms; }
		.cs-ho-f.is-in .cs-ho-art * { animation-delay: 450ms; }
	}

	/* No icon motion for reduced motion or lite mode. */
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.cs-ho-art * {
